{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10281090","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10281090","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1028109001:0":{"text":"Thanks to you, I was able to absorb the magic that escaped me. ","source_cn":"多亏了你们，这里逸散的魔力已经被我吸收了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF092237DB6264630","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1028109002:1":{"text":"Hewynn... that memory just now...","source_cn":"那个，伊温小姐，刚才那段记忆是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F66C7FB40DFED1A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1028109002":{"text":"Hewynn... that memory just now...","source_cn":"那个，伊温小姐，刚才那段记忆是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F66C7FB40DFED1A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1028109003:1":{"text":"Sorry! Because Chippy saw Hewynn's memories, Chippy thinks she's a gentle person! ","source_cn":"对不起嘛，因为满满看到了伊温小姐的记忆，觉得伊温小姐是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x646BFDEB4AA96BA9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1028109005:1":{"text":"It doesn't matter. For a long time, I didn't know how to master this power. Obviously, I was born of the water, but I couldn't figure out how to release its magic.","source_cn":"没关系的。诞生后的很长时间，我都不知道怎么掌握力量……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA39A344987FBA3B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1028109006:1":{"text":"It wasn't until I was brave enough to shed my tears that I realized that the magic of healing is the power of sharing and connecting. It takes emotional resonance to awaken. ","source_cn":"直到那天，我第一次勇敢地在别人面前哭泣，我才明白……“...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6C22B53594F3DC6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1028109007:0":{"text":"Since then, this memory has become the source of my magic, the most vibrant ripple of light...","source_cn":"从那以后，这段记忆就成为我魔法的源头，最潋滟的波光……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x951B1C9BD3843A15","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1028109008:0":{"text":"Sorry, I'm getting caught up in my memories... I still need to find the next location where my magic was lost.","source_cn":"啊，对不起，我自己陷入回忆里了……得快点找到第二处魔力...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A919150F9B7B116","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1028109008":{"text":"Sorry, I'm getting caught up in my memories... I still need to find the next location where my magic was lost.","source_cn":"啊，对不起，我自己陷入回忆里了……得快点找到第二处魔力逸散的位置。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A919150F9B7B116","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1028109009:1":{"text":"No, this time, I'm ready... look. ","source_cn":"不，这一次，我已经准备好了……请看。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD3A10433E03B769","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:11::2":{"text":"Hornleaf Bear's Leaf","source_cn":"叶角熊的叶子","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04EA41639C8AE0FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1028109010:0":{"text":"A leaf from a hornleaf bear, huh? ","source_cn":"咦，那是叶角熊的叶子吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD389D3F4D16A778A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1028109011:0":{"text":"This represents a very important memory...","source_cn":"嗯，它也代表着一段很重要的记忆……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80E605F4098D370F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1028109012:0":{"text":"The pull of magic... it's in that direction.","source_cn":"这次魔力逸散的方位……是在这边。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E2323635C7FA823","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:10:0:1":{"text":"What do we need this time?","source_cn":"这次需要准备什么触媒？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x283E6C05321420B9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"What do we need this time?","female":"What do we need this time?","variant_male_record_index":"61658","variant_female_record_index":"61659","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:4:0:1":{"text":"Chippy, don't...","source_cn":"满满，别这么唐突","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xBF98A05C2642B07D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Chippy, don't...","female":"Chippy, don't...","variant_male_record_index":"61654","variant_female_record_index":"61655","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1028109004:1":{"text":"Oh my...! By the way, Hewynn, we shouldn't have looked at your memories! ","source_cn":"哎呀……！对了，伊温小姐，我们不该贸然窥视你的记忆！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB8B5063DCA9953F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:4:1:2":{"text":"(Lightly pat Chippy's head)","source_cn":"（轻拍满满的脑袋）","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xED25566F3ED6E4D1","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"(Lightly pat Chippy's head)","female":"(Lightly pat Chippy's head)","variant_male_record_index":"61656","variant_female_record_index":"61657","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:伊温":{"text":"Hewynn","source":"伊温","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"s